    "reason": "The study used VBM and task-free fMRI, enrolled bvFTD patients and 14 controls, and reported whole-brain MNI-space group contrasts (I1-I5 met). It is original research and not limited to ROI, DTI, cortical thickness, or seed-only results (E1, E2, E4, E5 not_met). Excluded because five patients in each bvFTD group had comorbid motor neuron disease, violating E3."
