    ],
    "autonima": "included_fulltext",
    "reason": "The study uses MRI gray-matter probability/VBM-like analysis in MNI space and reports whole-brain bvFTD-versus-healthy-senior contrasts, with adequate bvFTD and control samples (I1-I5 met). However, the sample also includes corticobasal syndrome and semantic-variant PPA, other neurodegenerative conditions, so E3 applies."
   },
   {
    "pmid": "28724588",
    "decision": "exclude",
    "failed": [
     "I4"
    ],
    "autonima": "included_fulltext",
    "reason": "This is an empirical bvFTD study with adequate patient and control groups, an eligible voxelwise structural MRI analysis, and whole-brain group-level evidence (I1, I2, I3, I5). However, the full text does not demonstrate that the between-group result was reported in MNI or Talairach space (I4), so the study is excluded at full-text screening. It is not a review, ROI-only study, non-empirical paper, or prohibited-method-only study (E1, E2, E4, E5)."
