    "reason": "The study reports whole-brain VBM with stereotaxic coordinates and includes 69 bvFTD patients and 28 controls, satisfying I1-I5. However, the sample also includes 53 patients with Alzheimer\u2019s disease, an other dementia group, which meets exclusion criterion E3."
   },
   {
