    "autonima": "excluded_fulltext",
    "reason": "FDG-PET was used in 19 bvFTD patients and 19 controls, satisfying I1-I3. However, the whole-brain analysis reports correlations across the full sample with diagnostic group as a covariate, not a bvFTD-versus-control contrast, so I4 and I5 are not met. No review, ROI-only, or excluded-method-only design is shown (E1, E2, E4, E5 not met)."
