    "reason": "The study includes bvFTD and controls with adequate sample sizes and uses VBM (I1-I3). However, the reported VBM analysis is a patient-group correlation with controls excluded, and the analysis is restricted to atlas-defined ROIs; the other imaging analysis is seed-based connectivity. Thus the required bvFTD-versus-control whole-brain voxelwise evidence is not demonstrated (I4 and I5 not met), and E2 applies."
